# Fuzzing state: the corpus is regenerated by `cargo run --bin seed` and grown by
# libFuzzer, and artifacts are whatever the last run tripped over. A case worth
# keeping becomes a fixture under tests/fixtures/ instead.
fuzz/corpus/
fuzz/artifacts/
